<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>HANS COMPAIN AI App</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      background-color: #03060E;
      color: #F1F5F9;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .card {
      background: #070D1D;
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      max-width: 420px;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }
    .icon {
      width: 68px;
      height: 68px;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #0F172A;
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.5);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #94A3B8;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #0D9488);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.3);
      border: none;
    }
    .guide-box {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #0B132B;
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #38BDF8;
      text-align: left;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">📲</div>
    <h2>HANS COMPAIN OFFICIAL APP</h2>
    <p>
      ऐप शुरू करने के लिए नीचे दिए गए बटन पर टैप करें। मोबाइल की मुख्य स्क्रीन पर ऐप आइकन लगाने के लिए Chrome मेनू (3 डॉट्स) में जाकर <b>"Install app"</b> या <b>"Add to Home screen"</b> चुनें।
    </p>
    <button class="btn" onclick="openHansApp()">
      🚀 ऐप खोलें (Open Live App)
    </button>
    <div class="guide-box">
      <b>💡 स्क्रीन पर ऐप कैसे जोड़ें:</b><br/>
      1. ब्राउज़र में ऊपर <b>⋮ (3 डॉट्स)</b> दबाएं<br/>
      2. <b>'Install app'</b> या <b>'Add to Home screen'</b> चुनें<br/>
      3. ऐप सीधे मोबाइल स्क्रीन पर आ जाएगा!
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    function openHansApp() {
      if (window.location.origin && window.location.origin.startsWith('http')) {
        window.location.href = window.location.origin + '/';
      } else {
        window.location.href = '/';
      }
    }
    // Auto-redirect if opened inside an active HTTP session
    if (window.location.origin && window.location.origin.startsWith('http') && window.location.pathname.includes('.apk')) {
      setTimeout(function() {
        window.location.href = window.location.origin + '/';
      }, 500);
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
